y also indirectly regulate the production of lipid droplets and triacylglycerol. May antagonize BMP signaling."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}